OL,3,GNEWSAJudge praises girl for making
OL,4,Arapist face justice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who ignored a 12-year-old girl's
OL,7,Fpleas to stop as he raped her has been
OL,8,Fjailed for nine years.
OL,10,FCameron Kelsey was 19 when he attacked
OL,11,Fthe girl, who he had met online, at his
OL,12,Fthen home in Wallsend, Newcastle Crown
OL,13,FCourt heard.
OL,15,FThe girl said she felt "disgusted" and
OL,16,Fit was only as she got older she
OL,17,Frealised how serious what had happened
OL,18,Fwas. Judge Robert Spragg praised her
OL,19,Ffor reporting Kelsey and said she had
OL,20,Fprobably stopped others being harmed by
OL,21,Fthe rapist.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
